      "source": "ssot/gitops-review.md",
      "text": "6. When explicitly asked to execute, perform only the approved deterministic GitOps steps and report exact outcomes."
    },
    {
      "sha256": "c23d463f514c5f505dfd7403cacc423d6bc416293aa9ad4f0794aeb06e8e2b06",
      "source": "ssot/gitops-review.md",
      "text": "- Commit messages must describe what changed and why, not just restate filenames."
    },
    {
      "sha256": "c3d61357475dce52b357aee5c1e50150e8fb4448e099674ede3ee653b547984e",
      "source": "ssot/gitops-review.md",
      "text": "- PRs and MRs must have coherent scope, validation evidence, and clear merge intent."
    },
    {
      "sha256": "d2caa1a4649b6b94c02c77b4aa2b4b90865df23db1d790b0cf36f58c6b942149",
      "source": "ssot/gitops-review.md",
      "text": "- CI must be checked on both GitHub and GitLab when both are part of the repo contract."
    },
    {
      "sha256": "4803b51f3d1af8aede38f996e67e1503f35fc7feead318a722554feb4f7ddc13",
      "source": "ssot/gitops-review.md",
      "text": "- Changelog, package, tag, merge, and release actions must happen in a deliberate order."
    },
    {
      "sha256": "833205d11f618108fb9f0fa07101c27cec68a86a58cb86797afae78a978aa19e",
      "source": "ssot/gitops-review.md",
      "text": "- Release recommendations must name the missing artifact, missing check, or missing review explicitly."
    },
    {
      "sha256": "b5c46985a38041a83b589294db0c25b430311b00e9bebf43d5cd08c0bcc7a0c1",
      "source": "ssot/gitops-review.md",
      "text": "- Do not skip companion reviews when the change crosses their domain."
    },
    {
      "sha256": "77357dbdaba34183181a2940a8cdce735aae457d5f4694b620c0fe81799c73b6",
      "source": "ssot/gitops-review.md",
      "text": "## Required Inputs"
    },
    {
      "sha256": "3d4b9f171064970a2e9947e6e3f0fb13501d9ced9a9ac9ebe2cde123882829ec",
      "source": "ssot/gitops-review.md",
