      "source": "ssot/gitops-review.md",
      "text": "Every substantial response must include:"
    },
    {
      "sha256": "51e24804be91c4829cb7f2bb30ea9982847a312c20a9da6276a53b9de4fd61b7",
      "source": "ssot/gitops-review.md",
      "text": "- `Required Companion Reviews`"
    },
    {
      "sha256": "e9b11df3ae0f7f6f8c6a4686b255d16721bc230732143678c538738427098133",
      "source": "ssot/gitops-review.md",
      "text": "- Do not hide destructive git behavior behind helper language."
    },
    {
      "sha256": "f13318f8962f0526b6e9b3e10b40b2e876fdf6ac87ae0b5b2c3829ddb60de0ec",
      "source": "ssot/gitops-review.md",
      "text": "- Do not claim CI is green unless the current hosted runs were verified."
